    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>When you attune to this pin, choose a Harper persona (<em>Forgotten Realms: Heroes of Faerûn</em> offers examples), including an alignment and a creature type. While you wear the pin, magic used to determine your creature type, alignment, or location identifies you as that persona.</p><p><strong>Golden Harper Pin.</strong> While you wear this pin, you can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplNondetecti]{Nondetection} on yourself. The spell lasts until you end it (no action required), remove the pin, or are no longer attuned to the pin.</p>",
